# Architecture Rules

- `domain/` — pure Kotlin, no Android imports
- Game logic lives in `GameEngine`; bots in `BotAI`
- All game actions go through `GameClient` interface (local or remote)
- ViewModels call `GameClient`, never `GameEngine` directly
- Use `observeState()` Flow for tick polling; immediate `getState()` after actions
- Actions: `playCard`, `addCard`, `pass`, `bito`, `ready`, `leaveSession`
- DTOs in `data/api/dto/` with `@Serializable`; map to/from domain in repository

```kotlin
// ✅ ViewModel
gameClient.playCard(sessionId, card, targetPairId)

// ❌ ViewModel
gameEngine.playCard(card)
```
